OL,3,GNEWSAInquests open into seven who died
OL,4,Ain A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fpeople may find upsetting
OL,9,FSeven people, including two police
OL,10,Fofficers, killed in a car crash on the
OL,11,FA66 had fatal head injuries, an inquest
OL,12,Fhas provisionally concluded.
OL,14,FCleveland Police officers PC Matthew
OL,15,FBlades, 37, and PC Tom Clough, 38, died
OL,16,Fon Saturday when their police vehicle
OL,17,Fwas hit by a Volkswagen Passat which
OL,18,Fwas going the wrong way down the dual
OL,19,Fcarriageway near Middlesbrough.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
